<!--
  LOTAR 2026 worked example (D-25, 2026-10-28): minimal P550 link-set manifest for the InfiniRange
  Gate 2 baseline, as the p550 branch of the 500-series archive SSPExamples/EVRangeExampleV3_AIP/.
  Per WG decision S4b the TOP-LEVEL manifest records containment only; the semantic relationships of
  the baseline (requirement verified by scenario, model implements decision) are recorded HERE, as
  frozen records of the links that existed in the live PLM environment (linkType names the live
  technology; it is not how the archive resolves anything). P550's own link elements are plain
  strings in the current schema draft, so each record carries the two ends as LOTAR identifiers
  (metadataToModelElement = source, modelElementToElementLink = target) plus, as metadata, the
  archive-root-relative locator of the target for readers inside this archive. P550 is not in this
  project's scope; its schema is used as-is.
-->
